Let the control panel pick a group map's local group from the site's groups, instead of taking a group id typed by hand. The `@identity-providers` API now refuses a group map naming a group the site does not have, with a 400 that names it, so a typo or a group's title in place of its id no longer saves and then grants nothing at every login. A profile's `registry.xml` may still name a group that does not exist yet, because a later step may create it; the import stores the row and logs a warning. @ericof
